    "body": "Yes.  For that case I think the relationship is more obvious, as the 'halted' output from the hart simply connects to bit 0 of inhibit, and bit 1 is tied low.  Of course, any such system wouldn't have the ability to prevent tracing for security reasons.  Or put another way, any hart implementing the secure debug extension must have a version 2 HTI.  ",
